    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An Impressive Duplex Apartment With Exceptional and Uninterrupted Sea Views\r\n\r\nRarely does an opportunity arise to acquire a beachfront property in the highly sought-after and picturesque seaside village of Duncannon. Number 1 Strand Court is an exceptional 2/ 3 bedroom apartment commanding breathtaking panoramic views across Duncannon Bay, stretching from Hook Head to Woodstown and beyond. Extending to approximately 120 sq m, the spacious and thoughtfully designed accommodation has been carefully arranged to maximise the spectacular sea views. The bright open-plan living areas arranged over two levels feature floor-to-ceiling glazing, flooding the space with natural light and framing the ever-changing seascape, while providing direct access an outdoor patio, an ideal vantage point from which to enjoy the stunning surroundings. The apartment has been recent upgraded to include contemporary style and well-equipped kitchen, storage room, two generous double bedrooms plus study.  The apartment is ideally positioned to enjoy all that Duncannon has to offer, including its renowned Blue Flag beach, coastal walks, water sports, restaurants and village amenities. Whether as a permanent residence, holiday retreat or investment opportunity, Number 1 Strand Court represents a rare chance to secure a superb waterfront property in one of County Wexford's most desirable coastal locations. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 6m x 1.1m\r\n\r\nLivingroom 6m x 5.5m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1. 4m x 3m \r\n\r\nBedroom 2. 4m x 2.2m\r\n\r\nGuest w.c.\r\n\r\nLower Ground Floor\r\n\r\nKitchen 4m x 1.68m with range of fitted units \r\n\r\nLivingroom 5.5m x 3.9m\r\n\r\nDining area 4.5m x 2.5m which opens onto patio area \r\n\r\nStudy/ bedroom\r\n\r\nOutside:\tAmple parking and patio area\r\nServices:\tAll main services, G.F.C.H and service charge applies  \r\nBER:\tC2\t\r\nEircode:   Y34F216"
